NTRANDO EN MODO FASTBOOT...`** — Atrapa la caja por botón externo `RESET` y la retiene en `U-Boot Fastboot (PID_0D02)` con el `watchdog` apagado.\n   - **`[PASO 3/4] INYECTANDO FIRMWARE XVIEW LIBERADO...`** — Desbloquea e inyecta las particiones del firmware liberado (protegiendo `factory.img` y `cri_data.img`).\n   - **`[PASO 4/4] ¡ÉXITO TOTAL!`** — Concluye el proceso sin reiniciar al Android bloqueado.\n\nSigo en línea monitoreando [BITACORA_EN_VIVO_EXE.log](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/programa%20perfecto/BITACORA_EN_VIVO_EXE.log) en tiempo real mientras lo pruebas.","thinking":"The program is running but paused, awaiting user interaction. The task's persistent state suggests it's designed to continue indefinitely once started.\n\n\nThe previous version allowed the device to boot into normal Android due to an intermediate step. This was addressed in the updated version by removing all sub-menus and the `fastboot reboot` command. This ensures the process remains in fastboot mode and completes automatically through four direct steps.\n\n\n"}
