{"step_index":713,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-05T03:53:31Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-04T21:53:31-06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-04T21:53:31-06:00\nShowing lines 1-58 of 58\n1: @echo off\n2: setlocal ENABLEDELAYEDEXPANSION\n3: title ZTE-B866V2-OS12 [DESBLOQUEO + FLASHEO SEGURO + ANTI-WATCHDOG]\n4: chcp 65001 >nul\n5: cls\n6: cd /d \"%~dp0B866V2\"\n7: \n8: echo ============================================================================\n9: echo   ZTE B866V2 ANDROID 12 - DESBLOQUEO Y FLASHEO SEGURO (ANTI-WATCHDOG)\n10: echo ============================================================================\n11: echo [*] Esperando a que la caja entre en modo Fastboot por USB...\n12: \n13: :WAIT_FASTBOOT\n14: fastboot devices | findstr /i \"fastboot\" >nul\n15: if errorlevel 1 (\n16:     goto WAIT_FASTBOOT\n17: )\n18: \n19: echo [+] Caja detectada en Fastboot! Reteniendo conexion y ejecutando desbloqueo + OTG...\n20: fastboot oem \"watchdog off\"\n21: fastboot getvar version\n22: fastboot flashing unlock_critical\n23: fastboot flashing unlock\n24: fastboot oem \"setenv lock 10100000;save\"\n25: fastboot oem \"setenv otg_device 1;save\"\n26: fastboot oem \"setenv lock 10100000\"\n27: fastboot oem \"setenv otg_device 1\"\n28: fastboot oem \"saveenv\"\n29: fastboot getvar unlocked\n30: \n31: echo [*] Flasheando particiones de sistema Android 12 (protegiendo MAC/SN/Widevine)...\n32: fastboot flash boot boot.img\n33: fastboot flash bootloader bootloader.img\n34: fastboot flash _aml_dtb dtb.img\n35: fastboot flash dtbo dtbo.img\n36: REM SE OMITE factory.img y cri_data.img PARA NO BORRAR CLAVES DRM WIDEVINE L1 NI MAC/SN\n37: fastboot flash logo logo.img\n38: fastboot flash param param.img\n39: fastboot flash conf conf.img\n40: fastboot flash oem oem.img\n41: fastboot flash super super.img\n42: fastboot flash vbmeta vbmeta.img\n43: fastboot flash recovery recovery.img\n44: if exist \"..\\..\\..\\experimento\\11_VALIDACION_OTA_Y_FIRMWARE_ZTE\\cache_ext4.img\" (\n45:     fastboot flash cache \"..\\..\\..\\experimento\\11_VALIDACION_OTA_Y_FIRMWARE_ZTE\\cache_ext4.img\"\n46: ) else (\n47:     fastboot erase cache\n48: )\n49: fastboot erase userdata\n50: \n51: echo ============================================================================\n52: echo [+] PROCESO COMPLETADO. RETENIENDO CAJA EN FASTBOOT (ANTI-WATCHDOG ACTIVO)\n53: echo     La caja NO se reiniciara sola. Presiona Ctrl+C cuando desees salir.\n54: echo ============================================================================\n55: :KEEP_ALIVE\n56: fastboot getvar version >nul 2>&1\n57: timeout /t 2 /nobreak >nul\n58: goto KEEP_ALIVE\n(no newline at end of file)"}
